  "description": "SEEKING PLANNING PERMISSION FOR A REPLACEMENT GARAGE DOOR.\nEXISTING WHITE FIBREGLASS UP AND OVER SINGLE GARAGE DOOR IS IN POOR CONDITION AS IS OLD WOODEN FRAMEWORK SUPPORTING DOOR AND IS REQUESTED TO BE REPLACED WITH A HIGH QUALITY SECURE SPACE SAVING CROCODILE STOWAWAY ROLL UP GARAGE DOOR IN WHITE TO FIT WITHIN EXISTING SIDE BRICKWORK PILLARS. \nNO CHANGES ARE PLANNED TO THE EXISTING PROPERTY OR GARAGE FLOOR PLANS OR ELEVATIONS.\nTHE REPLACEMENT IS A UPGRADE RATHER THAN REDESIGN AND WILL ALSO ENHANCE THE APPEARANCE OF THE PROPERTY THROUGH A CLEANER AND MORE PRESTIGE FRONTAGE.\nREPLACEMENT OF THE UP AND OVER DOOR ALSO ELIMINATES OUTWARD SWING AND PROVIDES SAFER EASE OF USE AND ADDS EXTRA VALUABLE SPACE ON THE DRIVEWAY. \n\nExisting door size approx 7ft x 7ft  (212cm x 212cm). New door supplier info available at www.crocodile.co.uk",
